  "text": "```python\n        if not name.endswith('.md'):\n            continue\n        path = os.path.join(CLAIMS, name)\n        try:\n            record = read_record(path)\n        except Exception as e:\n            print('error reading %s: %s' % (name, e), file=sys.stderr)\n            failures.append(name)\n            continue\n\n        status = record.get('status')\n        needle = record.get('needle')\n        surfaces = record.get('surfaces', [])\n\n        if status == 'current':\n            if not needle:\n                print('claim %s is current but has no needle' % name, file=sys.stderr)\n                failures.append(name)\n                continue\n            if not surfaces:\n                print('claim %s is current but has no surfaces' % name, file=sys.stderr)\n                failures.append(name)\n                continue\n\n            squashed_needle = squash(needle)\n            for surface in surfaces:\n                surface_path = os.path.join(ROOT, surface)\n                if not os.path.isfile(surface_path):\n                    print('surface %s for claim %s does not exist' % (surface, name), file=sys.stderr)\n                    failures.append(name)\n                    break\n                with open(surface_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                    content = f.read()\n                if squashed_needle not in squash(content):\n                    print('needle for claim %s not found in surface %s' % (name, surface), file=sys.stderr)\n                    failures.append(name)\n                    break\n            else:\n                checked += 1\n\n        elif status == 'withdrawn':\n            if not needle:\n                print('claim %s is withdrawn but has no needle' % name, file=sys.stderr)\n                failures.append(name)\n                continue\n            if not surfaces:\n                print('claim %s is withdrawn but has no surfaces' % name, file=sys.stderr)\n                failures.append(name)\n                continue\n\n            squashed_needle = squash(needle)\n            for surface in surfaces:\n                surface_path = os.path.join(ROOT, surface)\n                if not os.path.isfile(surface_path):\n                    # If the surface doesn't exist, we can't verify absence, but typically this might be okay or an error depending on strictness.\n                    # The prompt says \"must appear in none of them\". If it doesn't exist, it certainly doesn't contain it.\n                    continue\n                with open(surface_path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                    content = f.read()\n                if squashed_needle in squash(content):\n                    print('needle for claim %s found in surface %s despite being withdrawn' % (name, surface), file=sys.stderr)\n                    failures.append(name)\n                    break\n            else:\n                checked += 1\n\n    if failures:\n        print('%d claims failed validation' % len(failures), file=sys.stderr)\n        return 1\n\n    print('all %d claims validated' % checked)\n    return 0\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    sys.exit(main())\n```",
